# This file ensures the Animations/Puzzles and Animations/Effects directories are tracked by git
# Animation clips will be generated by the PuzzleRivalsAnimationSetup editor script
# Run: PuzzleRivals -> Setup Verified Animation Sheets

# Animation file naming convention:
# - bomb_idle_08f_v01.png (8 frames for bomb idle animation)
# - bomb_held_08f_v01.png (8 frames for bomb held animation)
# - bomb_pass_12f_v01.png (12 frames for bomb pass animation)
# - explosion_24f_v01.png (24 frames for explosion animation)
# - collapse_grid_*.png (collapse grid animations)
# - pipe_*_*.png (pipe pulse animations)
# - mirror_maze_*.png (mirror maze animations)